<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The themed-icon layer, for Android 13 and up.

  **One colour, no fills of its own.** The system tints this layer to
  match the user's wallpaper palette, so every path has to be solid
  white and the shapes have to read without the two-tone distinction
  the full-colour icon uses. The book outline is therefore dropped: as
  a knocked-out gap it would vanish once everything is one colour.
-->
